1
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:39,333
Revenge gets ugly.

2
00:09:06,666 --> 00:09:12,666
Jonah Hex is a action, western, drama film directed by Jimmy Hayward.

3
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Gunslinger Jonah Hex is appointed by President Ulysses Grant to track down terrorist Quentin
Turnbull, a former Confederate officer determined on unleashing hell on earth.

4
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:19,333
Jonah not only secures freedom by accepting this task, he also
gets revenge on the man who slew his wife and child.

5
00:22:46,666 --> 00:22:52,666
Jonah Hex, played by Josh Brolin.

6
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:26,000
Turnbull, played by John Malkovich.

7
00:31:53,333 --> 00:31:59,333
Leila, played by Megan Fox.

8
00:36:26,666 --> 00:36:32,666
Burke, played by Michael Fassbender.

9
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:06,000
Lieutenant Grass, played by Will Arnett.

10
00:45:33,333 --> 00:45:39,333
Ulysses S. Grant, played by Aidan Quinn.

11
00:50:06,666 --> 00:50:12,666
Jonah Hex is a 2010 American Western superhero film based on
the DC Comics character of the same name.

12
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:46,000
Directed by Jimmy Hayward (in his live-action debut) from a screenplay by Neveldine/Taylor, the film stars Josh Brolin in
the title role, alongside John Malkovich, Megan Fox, Michael Fassbender, Will Arnett and Michael Shannon.

13
00:59:13,333 --> 00:59:19,333
Produced by Legendary Pictures, Andrew Lazar's Mad Chance Productions and Akiva Goldsman's
Weed Road Pictures, the film was released on June 18, 2010, by Warner Bros.

14
01:03:46,666 --> 01:03:52,666
It was a commercial failure, having grossed only $11
million against a budget of $47 million.

15
01:08:20,000 --> 01:08:26,000
It received generally negative reviews from critics.

16
01:12:53,333 --> 01:12:59,333
The film explores themes of gunslinger, hell, comic
book, based on comic, facial scar.

17
01:17:26,666 --> 01:17:32,666
The tone is emotional and intense.
